contract_literal|component|4d619a77ead4880cc383bbf8a2d3d79da3b2b6954be6c1f8d822d9d686823534|spec/alpha/platform/alpha-component-bundle-v0.fields
contract_literal|system-state-service|e0d936bf526d23517c5c3f89569f4f6154e32f2ff8e54f0eefb5d56c121cbe1f|literal-SHA256-of-RAR-ALPHA-SYSTEM-STATE-SERVICE-CONTRACT-V0
contract_literal|preserved-state-service|de2fde22216e7758bdd05cb86e0feac6705eaa7d516eee63e5b3dbf48091ac5c|literal-SHA256-of-RAR-ALPHA-PRESERVED-STATE-SERVICE-CONTRACT-V0
contract_literal|system-state-source|9a37e9427615559cdf7ac1022c27392ee82fec8cf56054a1211db75f03de5b8f|spec/alpha/platform/alpha-state-image-v0.fields
contract_literal|preserved-state-source|9a37e9427615559cdf7ac1022c27392ee82fec8cf56054a1211db75f03de5b8f|spec/alpha/platform/alpha-state-image-v0.fields
